#
# File: gratings.lut
#
# Database of available GMOS gratings.
#
# This file contains a list of all the gratings known to GMOS,
# whether fitted or not. Each time a new grating is purchased
# it should be assigned two barcodes (one for each possible
# orientation) and added to this list.
#
# Gratings whose barcodes start with 5000... in this table still
# need to have a barcode assigned.
#
# Grating focus offsets have not been measured and are assumed
# to be zero, as of 30 January 2001.
#
# New names suggested by Inger Jorgensen adopted on 22 Feb 2001.
#

# name            barcodeId     linesPerMm     blazeDir   focusOffset (microns)

mirror             30000012              0           0        0.0
Mirror1_rev        30000020              0           0        0.0

B1200+_G5321       30000016	      1200          +1      -50.6
B1200-_G5321       30000015           1200          -1      -50.6
R600+_G5324        30000018            600          +1      -54.4
R600-_G5324        30000017            600          -1      -54.4
B600-_G5323        30000013            600          -1        0.0
B600+_G5323        30000014            600          +1        0.0


